<bx:output>
	<h1>Executor load</h1>
	<bx:script>
		// Fill the small demo pool so its health report shows saturation in the console
		for ( i = 1; i <= 8; i++ ) {
			asyncRun( () => { sleep( 6000 ); return 1; }, "demo-pool" );
		}
	</bx:script>
	<p>Queued 8 tasks of 6 seconds on the 2 thread demo-pool. Open the console and watch Executors.</p>
</bx:output>
